{"4290780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orbital Outbreak", "steam_appid": 4290780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/9ffc3a82c1e493e43ed0e0b77336fad7.avif?t=1768587577\" width=1560 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within a fractured void in deep space, the game unfolds after a catastrophic event that shattered time, space, and planetary order. Inside this unstable void, planets drift unpredictably, time bends, and reality itself feels distorted. At the heart of the void lies a hidden truth, and every journey pushes closer to uncovering the secret behind the disaster that reshaped the universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a lone traveler navigating this dangerous expanse, moving from planet to planet in search of survival and answers. Each planet exists as a fully spherical world, forcing players to fight, move, and adapt to combat on curved surfaces. Hostile enemies roam these planets, each encounter testing reflexes, positioning, and mastery of fast-paced top-down shooter combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To continue the journey, players must extract vital resources known as Shards from planetary surfaces. Resource extraction is never safe—enemies attack relentlessly, turning every mission into a tense struggle between risk and reward. Success allows players to escape the planet and push deeper into the void, while failure resets the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Throughout each run, players discover upgrades and boosts that modify weapons and abilities, enabling powerful synergies and evolving playstyles. Combined with procedural planet generation, varied enemy encounters, and escalating difficulty, each run offers a fresh, unpredictable experience built around experimentation, mastery, and survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/9ffc3a82c1e493e43ed0e0b77336fad7.avif?t=1768587577\" width=1560 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set within a fractured void in deep space, the game unfolds after a catastrophic event that shattered time, space, and planetary order. Inside this unstable void, planets drift unpredictably, time bends, and reality itself feels distorted. At the heart of the void lies a hidden truth, and every journey pushes closer to uncovering the secret behind the disaster that reshaped the universe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/47945587af8b986e57c65270d09641a5.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a lone traveler navigating this dangerous expanse, moving from planet to planet in search of survival and answers. Each planet exists as a fully spherical world, forcing players to fight, move, and adapt to combat on curved surfaces. Hostile enemies roam these planets, each encounter testing reflexes, positioning, and mastery of fast-paced top-down shooter combat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/24be4cb17ebfa8cc008a1921a8c26a28.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To continue the journey, players must extract vital resources known as Shards from planetary surfaces. Resource extraction is never safe—enemies attack relentlessly, turning every mission into a tense struggle between risk and reward. Success allows players to escape the planet and push deeper into the void, while failure resets the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3aa759da66a81d24f3ba4fd91eb0ed66.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Throughout each run, players discover upgrades and boosts that modify weapons and abilities, enabling powerful synergies and evolving playstyles. Combined with procedural planet generation, varied enemy encounters, and escalating difficulty, each run offers a fresh, unpredictable experience built around experimentation, mastery, and survival.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.poster.avif?t=1768587577\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.webm?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/extras/3f995674ac89f0ffc2e31f0537b40adb.mp4?t=1768587577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A fast-paced action roguelite shooter set on spherical planets. Fight hordes of enemies on curved surfaces, extract resources, and push deeper into a fractured void where time and space are unstable. Master diverse weapons, build powerful synergies, and uncover the mystery at the heart of the void.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/3ef7b520e91bb6d8f454ea7e0c069b5108e9e40a/header.jpg?t=1768587577", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/a2151b6dcdeb8e6abfc885240eb8e0b1a38dd866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768587577", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290780/a2151b6dcdeb8e6abfc885240eb8e0b1a38dd866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768587577", "website": "https://kyodaigameworks.com/our-games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and 